seed 320
use binding
as ann register web-1.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use by-text

as ann grant
  grant call web::q to bob with grant option

as ann register web-2.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use by-int
as ann register web-3.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use by-text

grant
  grant call web-2.0 to bob with grant option
  grant call web-3.0 to bob with grant option

as bob grant
  grant call web-2.0 to ann with grant option

as bob grant error Invalid { detail: "`call` on `web-3.0` with grant option from `bob` to `ann` would close a cycle of grant options" }
  grant call web-3.0 to ann with grant option
